/Title (1. Technical foundation: operating systems, file systems, evidence handling and Chain of Custody.  2. Lab experience: imaging, file system analysis, data recovery and carving, memory and log analysis.  3. Legal knowledge: Egyptian Law No. 175 of 2018, admissibility requirements, presenting findings.  4. Certifications: start with CompTIA Security+ and CySA+, then specialize with GCFE, GCFA, CHFI.  5. Awareness: follow NICE updates, re-verify work role data against the latest version, keep developing practical and legal competencies.)
